  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The rationale for this dual approach was to build capacity on the central level at the same time as the new organisation acquired hands-on experience in the field through pilot projects in the county of Escuintla. The first programme phase was implemented 1997-2000, and the second 2001-2005.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Upon the establishment of UTJ - and following a request from the Guatemalan Government - Sweden initiated its support, using two different modalities and channels: financial support (through UNDP) technical assistance (Contract-financed Technical Cooperation, with Swedesurvey as the provider of the services).</narrative>
  </description>
